+"""Native display seam on the registered core owner: identity-addressed read, locate and check.
+
+Real ``GatewayRunner`` / ``SessionAuthority`` / registered Gadget adapter / ``SessionDB`` (the
+``relay_native_support`` rig). The existing position reader (``read_native_history_fragment``) is the
+oracle: every identity read must equal the fragment it yields, byte for byte.
+"""
